# CVS Health (CVSHealth.com)
CVS Health is an integrated health care company in the United States. It provides pharmacy services, health insurance benefits, and clinical care, including physical and behavioral health services. CVS Health focuses on improving access to care, affordability, and health outcomes for individuals, families, and communities.
CVSHealth.com is the official website of CVS Health and serves as the primary entry point for its services, subsidiaries, news, and impact initiatives.
